<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan declares 25 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan declares 25 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated Industries Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors has approved a 25 centavo per share cash dividend.</p>
<p>In its disclosure to the Philipine Stock Exchange, Bacnotan said the dividend will cover stockholders on record as of November 27, 1996. Payment date is set on November 29, the company said.</p>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated is the flagship company of the Phinma Group.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
